t excision only (6 eyes)</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.0 &#x000b1; 0.36 </td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2 &#x000b1;0.8 </td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">14.5&#x000b1;0.5</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">15&#x000b1;1.4</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">15.5&#x000b1;1.9 </td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2 wall bone + fat excision (7 eyes)</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.5 &#x000b1; 0.8 </td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4 &#x000b1; 1.1</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">18.2&#x000b1;2.8</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">18.6&#x000b1;1.0</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">17.1&#x000b1;2.7 </td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">3 wall bone + fat excision (5 eyes)</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.6 &#x000b1; 0.5</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5 &#x000b1; 2.6 </td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">17.4&#x000b1;3.7</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">17.5&#x000b1;3.7</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">17.4&#x000b1;3.2</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T2" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Comparison of Pre and Post Operative Autorefraction and Keratometry</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" width="100%"><thead><tr><th rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">AR 1</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">AR 2</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Axis</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">K1</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">K2</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Axis</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Median (range) Preoperative</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">-0.25 D (-1.75 to 2.75)</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">-0.5 D (-3 to -0.5)</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">47.5 (4 to 160) </td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">43.5 D (39.5-45.75)</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">44.5 D (41.5-47.25)</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">91.5 (8 to 165)</td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Median (range) Postoperative </td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.0 D (-2.25 to 3)</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">-0.75 D (-3.75 to 0.5)</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">62.5 (1 to 180)</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">44 D (40 to 45.25) </td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">44.75 D (42.5 to 47.25)</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">90.5 (7 to 135) </td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">P (Wilcoxon Signed Rank Test)</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">p = 0.89</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">p = 0.76</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">p = 0.42</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">p = 0.20</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">p = 0.06</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">p = 0.45</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="T2FN1"><p>Values following orbital decompression.</p></fn><fn id="T2FN2"><p>AR= autorefraction; K= keratometry.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>